The texts in mixins/betterf3/data/lang (en_us.json, ru_ru.json) are
BetterF3's own language files; the icon in mixins/betterf3/data/icon.png is
BetterF3's icon (fabric/src/main/resources/icon.png).

The config screens built with Cloth Config in BetterF3 follow Cloth Config by
shedaniel (https://github.com/shedaniel/cloth-config, LGPL-3.0), rewritten in
Rust (mixins/betterf3/cloth.rs); its error icon in
mixins/betterf3/cloth_sprites.rs is part of Cloth Config's texture
(assets/cloth-config2/textures/gui/cloth_config.png), converted to rows of
pixels, and its texts are Cloth Config's own.

This port rewrites BetterF3's modules, overlay and screens in Rust for
Horizon's native mod API, reading the game's own data where BetterF3 reads
Minecraft's. It is not affiliated with cominixo, TreyRuffy, Mojang or
Microsoft.
